          "type": "hero_text",
          "settings": {
            "eyebrow": "About US",
            "heading_source": "custom",
            "custom_heading": "Who We Are",
            "intro": "<p><strong>Dilmah</strong> is a Sri Lankan family tea company built on a simple but powerful belief: tea should remain true to its origin. We are rooted in authenticity, committed to quality, and guided by respect for the leaf, the land, and the people behind every cup.We do not see tea as a commodity. We see it as something shaped by place, craft, and care. That is why our story begins not in a boardroom, but at origin — where tea is grown, understood, and brought to life.</p>"
          }
        },
