          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p>Crafted by Leading Tea Experts</p>",
            "text": "<p>We are a family with a love for tea, and on a mission to make the world better tea. Dilmah Founder, Merrill J. Fernando, was the first grower to offer tea grown, picked and perfected right here in Sri Lanka where we grow our tea, to tea drinkers around the world.</p>",
