            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/7910d1kcqvdmmu74v3b_1.svg",
            "heading": "Handpicked Tea",
            "text": "<p>Made from crackling fresh young buds of the tea plant, hand-picked and sun-dried.</p>"
          }
        },
        "feature_item_nP8Vhh": {
